  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3042 specifies the smart traffic control and resource management functions for SUN. It defines the motivation and identifies the high-level requirements and functional architecture for providing relevant network capabilities. This Recommendation also identifies mechanisms in terms of "smart and ubiquitous" aspects of networks.</abstract>
